  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MOTT programme phase one ICD822 - 01/07/2015 to 30/06/2017
MOTT programme phase two ICD964 - 01/07/2017 to 30/06/2019

Phase Two
Sustainable Energy Access
1	Building CAFOD and partners&#x2019; evidence base for advocacy and programme design on &#x2018;socially inclusive sustainable energy for poverty reduction and development&#x2019;.
2	Building the evidence base on UK support for energy, as well as international support for energy in 1 key energy poor country (Kenya), to provide a baseline for evaluating whether such support is consistent with donor poverty reduction and development commitments (principally SDG7).
3	Supporting further development of the ACCESS coalition to influence relevant international and national processes.
4	Supporting our Southern partners and energy-poor communities to understand energy access issues and participate in energy access decision-making at the national/local level. 
5	Supporting wider research and advocacy on &#x2018;climate compatible energy pathways&#x2019;.</narrative>
  </description>
